named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m026-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002170","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m026-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"繆氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名、群體、夢中或神祇指代及提議用稱保留；不補姓名、個人成員或授位事實。"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m026-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"繆氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名、群體、夢中或神祇指代及提議用稱保留；不補姓名、個人成員或授位事實。"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m026-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002168","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m026-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"子公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002167","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m026-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"去疾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002169","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m026-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"繆氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名、群體、夢中或神祇指代及提議用稱保留；不補姓名、個人成員或授位事實。"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m026-0044","start":44,"end":49,"surface":"皆以爲大夫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名、群體、夢中或神祇指代及提議用稱保留；不補姓名、個人成員或授位事實。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng","book_id":"b-shiji-042","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-042-zheng"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p027","text":"襄公元年，楚怒鄭受宋賂縱華元，伐鄭。鄭背楚，與晉親。五年，楚復伐鄭，晉來救之。六年，子家卒，國人復逐其族，以其弒靈公也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m027-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002170","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m027-0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"元","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002163","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m027-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"華元","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002163","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m027-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"子家","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002166","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m027-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002168","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng","book_id":"b-shiji-042","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-042-zheng"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p028","text":"七年，鄭與晉盟鄢陵。八年，楚莊王以鄭與晉盟，來伐，圍鄭三月，鄭以城降楚。楚王入自皇門，鄭襄公肉袒掔羊以迎，曰：「孤不能事邊邑，使君王懷怒以及獘邑，孤之罪也。敢不惟命是聽。君王遷之江南，及以賜諸侯，亦惟命是聽。若君王不忘厲、宣王，桓、武公，哀不忍絶其社稷，錫不毛之地，使復得改事君王，孤之願也，然非所敢望也。敢布腹心，惟命是聽。」莊王爲卻三十里而後舍。楚群臣曰：「自郢至此，士大夫亦久勞矣。今得國捨之，何如？」莊王曰：「所爲伐，伐不服也。今已服，尚何求乎？」卒去。晉聞楚之伐鄭，發兵救鄭。其來持兩端，故遲，比至河，楚兵已去。晉將率或欲渡，或欲還，卒渡河。莊王聞，還撃晉。鄭反助楚，大破晉軍於河上。十年，晉來伐鄭，以其反晉而親楚也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m028-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"楚莊王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002171","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m028-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002171","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m028-0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"鄭襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002170","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m028-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"君王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002171","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m028-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"君王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002171","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m028-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"君王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002171","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m028-0109","start":109,"end":110,"surface":"厲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002096","status":"contextual_provis